/* v49: short summaries of the long Magic Items (DMG 2024), written in our own words. The full text stays under a fold */
export var MAGIC_SUM={"Alchemy Jug":"Magic action: name a liquid and the jug makes it, poured at up to 2 gallons per minute. Maximums run from 4 ounces (Basic Poison) to 12 gallons (salt water). No switching liquids until dawn.","Apparatus of Kwalish":"Sealed Large iron barrel vehicle (AC 20, 200 HP) with 10 levers for legs, claws, shutters, and lights. Claws hit at +8 for 2d6 Bludgeoning or grapple (escape DC 15). Holds 10 hours of air.","Arrow, +1":"Magic ammunition that gives +1 to attack and damage rolls. It becomes ordinary once it hits a target.","Axe of the Dwarvish Lords":"Artifact battleaxe with +3, extra 20 Slashing on a natural 20, and a returning throw adding 1d8 Force (2d8 vs Giants). Attuned owner gains Darkvision, Fire resistance, Poison immunity. Magic action summons an Earth Elemental.","Bag of Holding":"Extradimensional bag holding 500 pounds or 64 cubic feet while weighing 5 pounds. Removing an item takes a Utilize action. Putting it inside another extradimensional space destroys both and opens an Astral gate.","Berserker Axe":"Cursed Battleaxe, Greataxe, or Halberd with +1. Your Hit Point maximum rises by your level. When damaged, make a DC 15 Wisdom save or go berserk and attack the nearest creature.","Bolt, +3":"Magic ammunition that gives +3 to attack and damage rolls. It becomes ordinary once it hits a target.","Boots of the Winterlands":"Grants Resistance to Cold damage and comfort in temperatures of 0 degrees Fahrenheit or lower. Ice and snow Difficult Terrain doesn't slow you.","Candle of Invocation":"Burns up to 4 hours. Lit, it sheds Dim Light 30 feet, gives Advantage on D20 Tests, and lets Clerics and Druids cast prepared level 1 spells free. Alternatively casts Gate once, destroying it.","Censer of Controlling Air Elementals":"Magic action: summon an Air Elemental that obeys you for 1 hour. You can dismiss it with a Bonus Action. Usable once per day, recharging at dawn.","Cloak of Invisibility":"Has 3 charges and regains 1d3 at dawn. As a Magic action, spend 1 charge to raise the hood and become Invisible for 1 hour. Lowering the hood ends the effect.","Crystal Ball of Telepathy":"Touch it to cast Scrying (save DC 17) and speak telepathically to creatures within 30 feet of the sensor. Also cast Suggestion (DC 17) through it once per day, recharging at dawn.","Daern's Instant Fortress":"Magic action: place the statuette and a 20-foot-square, 30-foot-tall adamantine tower appears. Walls, roof, and door have AC 20 and 100 HP. The door opens only on your Bonus Action command. Only Wish repairs it.","Decanter of Endless Water":"Magic action: pour fresh or salt water as Splash (1 gallon), Fountain (5 gallons), or Geyser (30 gallons, 30-foot Line). Geyser target makes a DC 13 Strength save or takes 1d4 Bludgeoning and falls Prone.","Demon Armor":"Cursed armor giving +1 AC and Abyssal. Unarmed Strikes deal 1d8 Slashing with +1 to hit and damage. You can't remove it, and you have Disadvantage on attacks and saves against demons.","Driftglobe":"Glass globe that sheds light like Light or Daylight within 60 feet of you. Daylight recharges at dawn. A Magic action makes it float up to 5 feet above the ground and follow you.","Dwarven Thrower":"Warhammer with +3 to attack and damage and the Thrown property (range 20/60). A ranged hit adds 1d8 Force, or 2d8 against Giants. It returns to your hand after the attack.","Enspelled Armor":"Armor with a bound Abjuration or Illusion spell, cast for 1 of 6 charges. Regains 1d6 at dawn. Save DC 13 to 18 and attack bonus +5 to +10 scale with spell level.","Enspelled Armor (level 6, 7, or 8 spell)":"Legendary armor with a bound level 6 to 8 Abjuration or Illusion spell, cast for 1 of 6 charges. Regains 1d6 at dawn. Level 6: DC 17, +9. Levels 7 or 8: DC 18, +10.","Enspelled Staff (level 4 or 5 spell)":"Very Rare staff with a bound level 4 or 5 spell, cast for 1 of 6 charges. Regains 1d6 at dawn. Level 4: DC 15, +7. Level 5: DC 17, +9.","Enspelled Weapon (level 2 or 3 spell)":"Rare weapon with a bound level 2 or 3 spell, cast for 1 of 6 charges. Regains 1d6 at dawn. Level 2 uses DC 13 and +5, level 3 uses DC 15 and +7.","Eversmoking Bottle":"Magic action to open or close. Open, it releases smoke filling a 60-foot Emanation that Heavily Obscures the area and grows 10 feet per minute up to 120 feet. Smoke disperses 10 minutes after closing.","Figurine of Wondrous Power (bronze griffon)":"Magic action: throw it within 60 feet to become a Griffon ally for up to 6 hours. After use it stays inert for 5 days. It reverts early at 0 Hit Points.","Figurine of Wondrous Power (marble elephant)":"Magic action: throw it within 60 feet to become an Elephant ally for up to 24 hours. After use it stays inert for 7 days. It reverts early at 0 Hit Points.","Figurine of Wondrous Power (silver raven)":"Magic action: throw it within 60 feet to become a Raven ally for up to 12 hours. Inert for 2 days after use. In raven form you can cast Animal Messenger on it.","Flame Tongue":"Any Melee weapon. Bonus Action and command word ignite it, shedding Bright Light 40 feet and Dim Light 40 feet more. While burning, hits deal an extra 2d6 Fire damage.","Giant Slayer":"Simple or Martial weapon with +1 to attack and damage. Hitting a Giant deals an extra 2d6 damage of the weapon's type, and the Giant makes a DC 15 Strength save or falls Prone.","Hammer of Thunderbolts":"Maul or Warhammer with +1 and 5 charges. Spend 1 to throw it, Stunning creatures near the target on a failed DC 17 Constitution save. Regains 1d4 + 1 at dawn.","Hat of Wizardry":"Serves as a Spellcasting Focus for Wizard spells. Magic action to try casting a Wizard cantrip you don't know with a DC 10 Intelligence (Arcana) check. Usable once per Long Rest.","Heward's Handy Spice Pouch":"Has 10 charges. Magic action while holding it: spend 1 charge, name a nonmagical seasoning, and pull out one pinch for a meal. Regains 1d6 + 4 charges at dawn.","Horn of Valhalla (brass)":"Magic action: call 3 Berserker spirits for 1 hour, friendly if you have proficiency with all Simple weapons, hostile otherwise. They are immune to Charmed and Frightened. Inert for 7 days after use.","Horseshoes of a Zephyr":"Set of four, each fitted by a Magic action. With all four, the creature hovers 4 inches up, crosses lava or water, leaves no tracks, ignores Difficult Terrain, and avoids travel Exhaustion.","Instrument of Scribing":"Has 3 charges. Magic action and 1 charge write a message of up to six words on a surface within 30 feet. Bards get seven more words. Fades in 24 hours.","Instrument of the Bards (Cli lyre)":"Play to cast Fly, Invisibility, Levitate, Protection from Evil and Good, Stone Shape, Wall of Fire, or Wind Wall, each once per dawn. Unattuned players face DC 15 Wisdom save or 2d4 Psychic.","Instrument of the Bards (Ollamh harp)":"Play to cast Fly, Invisibility, Levitate, Protection from Evil and Good, Confusion, Control Weather, or Fire Storm, each once per dawn, using your DC. Unattuned players face DC 15 Wisdom save or 2d4 Psychic.","Ioun Stone (awareness)":"Magic action to toss it so it orbits your head, up to three stones at once. While orbiting, you have Advantage on Initiative rolls and Wisdom (Perception) checks.","Ioun Stone (intellect)":"Magic action to toss it so it orbits your head, up to three stones at once. While orbiting, your Intelligence score rises by 2, to a maximum of 20.","Ioun Stone (regeneration)":"Magic action to toss it so it orbits your head, up to three stones at once. At the end of each hour it orbits, you regain 15 Hit Points if you have at least 1.","Iron Bands of Bilarro":"Magic action: hurl at a Huge or smaller creature within 60 feet, attacking with Proficiency Bonus + Dex modifier. A hit Restrains it. Breaking free needs a DC 20 Strength (Athletics) check. Once per dawn.","Lantern of Revealing":"Burns 6 hours per pint of oil, with Bright Light 30 feet and Dim Light 30 feet more. Invisible things in Bright Light are seen. Utilize action lowers the hood.","Mace of Smiting":"Mace with +1 to attack and damage, or +3 against Constructs. A natural 20 deals extra 7 Bludgeoning, or 14 to Constructs, and destroys a Construct left with 25 HP or fewer.","Manual of Golems":"Book for building a golem, usable by casters with two level 5 slots. Clay needs 30 days and 65,000 GP, Flesh 60 and 50,000, Stone 90 and 80,000, Iron 120 and 100,000.","Mithral Armor":"Medium or Heavy armor except Hide. Has no Strength requirement and never imposes Disadvantage on Dexterity (Stealth) checks.","Necklace of Prayer Beads":"Holds 1d4 + 2 magic beads. While worn, cast a bead's spell as a Bonus Action, once per dawn each. Spells include Bless, Cure Wounds (level 2), Greater Restoration, and Wind Walk.","Nine Lives Stealer":"Simple or Martial weapon with +2 and 1d8 + 1 charges. A natural 20 on a creature under 100 HP forces a DC 15 Constitution save or death, costing 1 charge.","Oil of Sharpness":"One vial coats a nonmagical Piercing or Slashing Melee weapon or 20 pieces of ammunition. Applying takes 1 minute and turns it into +3 equipment.","Pipes of Haunting":"Has 3 charges, regains 1d3 at dawn. Magic action and 1 charge: creatures within 30 feet make a DC 15 Wisdom save or are Frightened for 1 minute. Successes are immune for 24 hours.","Pot of Awakening":"Plant a normal shrub in it for 30 days and the shrub becomes a friendly Awakened Shrub that follows your commands. The pot breaks when it awakens.","Potion of Giant Strength (fire)":"Sets your Strength score to 25 for 1 hour. It does nothing if your Strength is already 25 or higher.","Potion of Giant Strength (storm)":"Sets your Strength score to 29 for 1 hour. It does nothing if your Strength is already 29 or higher.","Potion of Resistance":"Grants Resistance to one damage type for 1 hour. The type is chosen by the DM or rolled on a d10 from Acid, Cold, Fire, Force, Lightning, Necrotic, Poison, Psychic, Radiant, and Thunder.","Quaal's Feather Token (anchor)":"Single use. Magic action: touch it to a ship or boat and nothing can move that vessel for 24 hours. Touching it again ends the effect early.","Quaal's Feather Token (tree)":"Single use, outdoors only. Magic action: touch it to unoccupied ground to make a nonmagical oak 60 feet tall with a 5-foot trunk and a 20-foot-radius crown.","Ring of Djinni Summoning":"Magic action: call a specific Djinni within 120 feet. It stays up to 1 hour while you Concentrate and is friendly. Can't recall it for 24 hours. If it dies, the ring loses its magic.","Ring of Shooting Stars":"Casts Light or Dancing Lights. Has 6 charges, regains 1d6 at dawn. Spend 1 for Faerie Fire, 2 for Lightning Spheres (DC 15 Dex), or 1 to 3 for Shooting Stars dealing 5d4 Radiant each.","Ring of X-ray Vision":"Magic action: 30-foot X-ray vision for 1 minute, through 3 feet of wood or dirt, 1 inch of metal, or 1 foot of stone. Reuse before a Long Rest risks Exhaustion (DC 15 Constitution).","Robe of Stars":"Gives +1 to saving throws. Magic action pulls off one of six stars to cast Magic Missile at level 5, with 1d6 stars returning at dusk. Another Magic action travels to the Astral Plane.","Rod of Alertness":"Advantage on Initiative and Perception while held. Casts See Invisibility and three Detect spells. Magic action plants it for a 60-foot aura giving allies +1 AC and saves for 10 minutes.","Rod of Security":"Magic action: take yourself and up to 199 willing creatures to a demiplane you design. Visitors heal and stay up to 200 divided by creature count days. Usable again after 10 days.","Rope of Climbing":"60-foot rope holding 3,000 pounds. Magic action commands it to move 10 feet per turn, tie, untie, knot, or coil. Knotted, it is 50 feet and aids climbing. It has AC 20 and 20 HP.","Scarab of Protection":"Grants +1 AC and Advantage on saves against spells. Has 12 charges. As a Reaction, spend 1 to turn a failed save against Necromancy or Undead effects into a success. It crumbles when empty.","Shield of Missile Attraction":"Cursed Shield giving Resistance to damage from Ranged weapon attacks. Ranged attacks aimed at creatures within 10 feet of you are redirected to you. The curse persists until Remove Curse or similar magic.","Sling Bullet, +3":"Magic ammunition that gives +3 to attack and damage rolls. It becomes ordinary once it hits a target.","Staff of Adornment":"Float up to three Tiny objects of 1 pound or less above the tip. You can make them turn or spin slowly while you hold it.","Staff of Flowers":"Has 10 charges. Magic action and 1 charge grow a harmless nonmagical flower within 5 feet. Regains 1d6 + 4 charges at dawn. Using the last charge risks 1 on a d20 destroying it.","Staff of Striking":"Magic Quarterstaff with +3 and 10 charges. On a melee hit, spend up to 3 charges for 1d6 extra Force damage each. Regains 1d6 + 4 at dawn. Emptying it risks ruin on a 1.","Staff of the Python":"Magic action: throw it to make a Giant Constrictor Snake you command. Bonus Action turns it back and heals it fully, then 1 hour wait. If the snake dies, the staff is destroyed.","Stone of Controlling Earth Elementals":"Hold the 5-pound stone to the ground and use a Magic action to summon an Earth Elemental within 30 feet. It obeys you for 1 hour. Usable once per day, recharging at dawn.","Sword of Life Stealing":"Glaive, Greatsword, Longsword, Rapier, Scimitar, or Shortsword. A natural 20 against a non-Construct, non-Undead deals extra 15 Necrotic damage and gives you Temporary Hit Points equal to it.","Sylvan Talon":"Dagger, Rapier, Scimitar, Shortsword, Sickle, or Spear. You and Fey understand each other's spoken communication while you carry it. Magic action casts Message once per dawn.","Talking Doll":"Spend a Short Rest to teach it up to six phrases of six words or fewer, each tied to a trigger within 5 feet. It forgets them when your attunement ends.","Tome of Leadership and Influence":"Reading and practicing for 48 hours within 6 days raises your Charisma score by 2, to a maximum of 30. The magic then fades for a century.","Vorpal Sword":"Glaive, Greatsword, Longsword, or Scimitar with +3 to attack and damage that ignores Slashing Resistance. A natural 20 severs a head, killing most creatures. Others take extra 30 Slashing damage.","Wand of Fear":"Has 7 charges, regains 1d6 + 1 at dawn. Cast Command (flee or grovel) for 1 charge or Fear (60-foot Cone) for 3, save DC 15. Spending the last charge risks destruction on a 1.","Wand of Orcus":"Artifact wand used as a +3 Mace dealing extra 2d12 Necrotic, giving +3 AC. Has 7 charges for necromancy spells (DC 18). Magic action raises 15 Zombies and 15 Skeletons. Attuning risks death (DC 17).","Wave":"Artifact trident with +3, extra 21 Necrotic on a natural 20, and Advantage on Initiative. Has 3 charges for Dominate Beast (DC 20). Casts level 9 Globe of Invulnerability once per dawn.","Wings of Flying":"Magic action turns the cloak into wings giving a 60-foot Fly Speed for 1 hour or until ended by a Magic action. Afterward you can't use them for 1d12 hours.","Ammunition of Slaying":"Ammunition made against one creature type. A damaged creature of that type makes a DC 17 Constitution save or takes extra 6d10 Force, half on a success. It then loses its magic.","Armor of Invulnerability":"Plate Armor granting Resistance to Bludgeoning, Piercing, and Slashing damage. Magic action: gain Immunity to those types for 10 minutes. Usable once per dawn.","Arrow, +2":"Magic ammunition that gives +2 to attack and damage rolls. It becomes ordinary once it hits a target.","Baba Yaga's Dancing Broom":"Magic action: turn the broom into an Animated Broom you control with mental orders within 30 feet. A Bonus Action and command word return it to normal. It heals fully when reverting.","Bag of Tricks":"Magic action: toss a fuzzy object up to 20 feet and it becomes a friendly animal rolled on a d8 table by bag color. It lasts until dawn. Three uses per day.","Blackrazor":"Artifact greatsword with +3, Blindsight 30 feet, and immunity to Charmed and Frightened. Devours souls of creatures it drops to 0 HP, granting Temporary HP. Casts Haste on you once per dawn.","Book of Exalted Deeds":"Artifact needing 80 hours of study. Grants Psychic resistance, immunity to Charmed and Frightened, +2 Wisdom (max 24), a halo of light, and spell slots counting one level higher. Benefits lapse if you do evil.","Bowl of Commanding Water Elementals":"Filled with water, it lets a Magic action summon a Water Elemental that obeys you for 1 hour. Usable once per dawn. A Bonus Action dismisses it.","Cape of the Mountebank":"Magic action: cast Dimension Door, leaving smoke that Lightly Obscures your old space until your next turn ends. Usable once per dawn.","Chime of Opening":"Magic action: strike it to cast Knock with a ringing tone heard 300 feet away. It works 10 times, then cracks.","Cloak of Many Fashions":"Bonus Action: change the cloak's style, color, and apparent quality. It stays a cloak, and copying another magic cloak's look grants none of its powers.","Cube of Force":"Has 10 charges, regaining 1d6 at dawn. Press a face to cast a spell (DC 17). Mage Armor and Shield cost 1, Tiny Hut 3, Private Sanctum 4, Resilient Sphere 4, Wall of Force 5.","Dagger of Venom":"Dagger with +1. Bonus Action: coat it in poison until a hit or 1 minute. The target makes a DC 15 Constitution save or takes 2d10 Poison and is Poisoned. Once per dawn.","Deck of Illusions":"Deck of 34 cards. Magic action: toss a random card within 30 feet to create a harmless illusory creature. A Study action and DC 15 Investigation check reveals it. The card is then used up.","Demonomicon of Iggwilv":"Artifact book with 8 charges, regaining 1d8 at dawn, for spells (DC 20). Imprisons Fiends in a Magic Circle (DC 20 Charisma save). Gives Advantage on demon lore and max damage on spells against Fiends.","Dust of Disappearance":"Utilize action: fling it to make you and everything in a 10-foot Emanation Invisible for 2d4 minutes. Casting, damaging, or attacking ends it for that creature.","Efreeti Bottle":"Magic action: open it to release an Efreeti. A d10 decides: hostile on 1, obedient for 1 hour on 2 to 9, one Wish on 10. Repeated openings may free it.","Enspelled Armor (cantrip or level 1 spell)":"Uncommon armor with a bound Abjuration or Illusion cantrip or level 1 spell, cast for 1 of 6 charges. Regains 1d6 at dawn. Save DC 13, attack bonus +5.","Enspelled Staff":"Staff with a bound spell of level 8 or lower, cast for 1 of 6 charges. Regains 1d6 at dawn. Save DC 13 to 18 and attack bonus +5 to +10 scale with spell level.","Enspelled Staff (level 6, 7, or 8 spell)":"Legendary staff with a bound level 6 to 8 spell, cast for 1 of 6 charges. Regains 1d6 at dawn. Level 6: DC 17, +9. Levels 7 or 8: DC 18, +10.","Enspelled Weapon (level 4 or 5 spell)":"Very Rare Simple or Martial weapon with a bound level 4 or 5 spell, cast for 1 of 6 charges. Regains 1d6 at dawn. Level 4: DC 15, +7. Level 5: DC 17, +9.","Eye of Vecna":"Artifact eye fused to your head. Gives Truesight 240 feet, X-ray vision, and 8 charges for spells (DC 18). Each cast has a 5 percent chance Vecna takes over your body. Alignment becomes Neutral Evil.","Figurine of Wondrous Power (ebony fly)":"Magic action: throw it within 60 feet to become a Giant Fly you can ride, for up to 12 hours. Inert for 2 days after use. It reverts early at 0 Hit Points.","Figurine of Wondrous Power (obsidian steed)":"Magic action: throw it within 60 feet to become a Nightmare for up to 24 hours. Inert for 5 days. Each use has a 10 percent chance it disobeys and carries a rider to Hades.","Firearm Bullet, +1":"Magic ammunition that gives +1 to attack and damage rolls. It becomes ordinary once it hits a target.","Folding Boat":"12-inch box. Magic action with the first command word makes a Rowboat, the second a Keelboat, the third folds it back if empty. Destroyed if either boat drops to 0 Hit Points.","Glamoured Studded Leather":"Studded Leather Armor giving +1 AC. Bonus Action: make it look like ordinary clothes or another armor of your choice. The illusion lasts until you change it or remove the armor.","Hand of Vecna":"Artifact hand fused to your arm. Sets Strength to 20, adds 2d8 Cold to melee hits, and has 8 charges for spells (DC 18). Each cast forces an evil Suggestion on you.","Helm of Brilliance":"Gem-studded helm. Diamonds harm nearby Undead, fire opals ignite a weapon for extra 1d6 Fire, rubies give Fire resistance. Casting Daylight, Fireball, Prismatic Spray, or Wall of Fire (DC 18) consumes a gem.","Holy Avenger":"Simple or Martial weapon with +3 and extra 2d10 Radiant against Fiends and Undead. While drawn, a 10-foot Emanation gives you and friends Advantage on saves against spells (30 feet at Paladin 17).","Horn of Valhalla (bronze)":"Magic action: call 4 Berserker spirits for 1 hour. They obey if you have training with all Medium armor, otherwise they attack you. Immune to Charmed and Frightened. Inert for 7 days.","Horseshoes of Speed":"Set of four. Magic action fits one on a horse's hoof. With all four attached, the creature's Speed increases by 30 feet.","Instrument of the Bards":"Seven bard college instruments, all casting Fly, Invisibility, Levitate, and Protection from Evil and Good, plus three or four more each. Each spell once per dawn, using your DC. Unattuned players risk 2d4 Psychic.","Instrument of the Bards (Doss lute)":"Play to cast Fly, Invisibility, Levitate, Protection from Evil and Good, Animal Friendship, Protection from Energy (Fire only), or Protection from Poison, each once per dawn.","Ioun Stone":"Magic action: toss it to orbit your head, up to three at once. Each type gives its own benefit, such as ability scores up by 2 (max 20), +1 AC, or 15 HP per hour.","Ioun Stone (fortitude)":"Magic action to toss it so it orbits your head, up to three stones at once. While orbiting, your Constitution score rises by 2, to a maximum of 20.","Ioun Stone (leadership)":"Magic action to toss it so it orbits your head, up to three stones at once. While orbiting, your Charisma score rises by 2, to a maximum of 20.","Ioun Stone (reserve)":"Magic action to toss it into orbit. It stores up to 4 levels of spells cast into it. While orbiting, you can cast a stored spell using the original caster's DC and attack bonus.","Iron Flask":"Magic action: target a creature within 60 feet from another plane. It is trapped unless it passes a DC 17 Wisdom save. Releasing it takes a Magic action, and it obeys you for 1 hour.","Luck Blade":"Glaive, Greatsword, Longsword, Rapier, Scimitar, Shortsword, or Sickle with +1 to attack and damage, and +1 to saves while carried. Reroll one failed D20 Test per dawn. Starts with 1d3 Wish charges.","Mace of Terror":"Mace with 3 charges, regaining 1d3 at dawn. Magic action and 1 charge: creatures within 30 feet make a DC 15 Wisdom save or are Frightened for 1 minute and must flee.","Manual of Quickness of Action":"Studying for 48 hours within 6 days raises your Dexterity score by 2, to a maximum of 30. The book then loses its magic for a century.","Moonblade":"Elven Greatsword, Longsword, Rapier, Scimitar, or Shortsword that accepts only a chosen bearer, cursing others with Disadvantage on D20 Tests for 24 hours. Has 1d6 + 1 runes, the first giving +1.","Needle, +1":"Magic ammunition that gives +1 to attack and damage rolls. It becomes ordinary once it hits a target.","Nolzur's Marvelous Pigments":"Box with a brush and 1d4 pots. One pot and 10 minutes of Concentration paint real objects inside a 20-foot Cube. Each item is worth 25 GP or less, 500 GP total. Painted energy fades.","Oil of Slipperiness":"One vial coats a Medium or smaller creature in 10 minutes, granting Freedom of Movement for 8 hours. Or Magic action: pour it for a 10-foot square of Grease lasting 8 hours.","Pipes of the Sewers":"Rats are Indifferent to you. Has 3 charges, regaining 1d3 at dawn. After a Magic action, spend 1 to 3 charges as a Bonus Action to summon that many Swarms of Rats.","Potion of Diminution":"Grants the reduce effect of Enlarge/Reduce for 1d4 hours without needing Concentration.","Potion of Giant Strength (frost)":"Sets your Strength score to 23 for 1 hour. It does nothing if your Strength is already 23 or higher.","Potion of Growth":"Grants the enlarge effect of Enlarge/Reduce for 10 minutes without needing Concentration.","Potion of Vitality":"Removes all Exhaustion levels and ends Poisoned. For 24 hours, each Hit Point Die you spend restores its maximum possible Hit Points.","Quaal's Feather Token (bird)":"Single use. Magic action: toss it to create a giant Roc-like bird that can't attack. It carries 500 pounds at 16 mph up to 144 miles a day, or 1,000 pounds at half speed.","Quaal's Feather Token (whip)":"Single use. Magic action: throw it to make a floating whip for 1 hour. Bonus Action: it strikes within 10 feet at +9 for 1d6 + 5 Force, and can move 20 feet.","Ring of Elemental Command":"Tied to one element. Gives Advantage against Elementals, a Magic action to charm one (DC 18 Wisdom), and element perks. Has 5 charges, regaining 1d4 + 1 at dawn, for spells (DC 18).","Ring of Spell Storing":"Stores up to 5 levels of spells cast into it by any creature, level 1 to 5. The wearer can cast stored spells using the original caster's DC, attack bonus, and slot level.","Rival Coin":"1 charge, regained at dawn. Magic action: flip it. Heads: a creature within 60 feet makes a DC 13 Wisdom save or takes 2d4 Psychic and has Disadvantage on an attack. Tails: you take 1d4.","Robe of the Archmagi":"Base AC 15 plus Dexterity modifier with no armor. Advantage on saves against spells and magical effects. Your spell save DC and spell attack bonus each rise by 2.","Rod of Lordly Might":"Mace with +3 and six buttons that morph it into a flaming sword, Battleaxe, Spear, climbing pole, ram, or compass. Also Drain Life, Paralyze, and Terrify (DC 17), each once per dawn.","Rod of the Pact Keeper, +1":"Gives +1 to spell attack rolls and Warlock spell save DCs while held. Magic action: regain one spell slot, usable once per Long Rest.","Rope of Entanglement":"30-foot rope. Magic action: lash at a creature within 20 feet, who makes a DC 15 Dexterity save or is Restrained. Escape needs a DC 15 Acrobatics or Athletics check. AC 20, 20 HP.","Scroll of Protection":"Magic action to read: creates a 5-foot Emanation for 5 minutes that creatures of one chosen type can't enter or affect. A nearby creature can overcome it with a DC 15 Charisma save.","Shield of the Cavalier":"Shield giving an extra +2 AC. Forceful Bash deals 2d6 + 2 + Strength modifier Force and can shove or knock Prone. Reaction: create a protective 5-foot Emanation for 1 minute, once per dawn.","Sovereign Glue":"Glue found in 1d6 + 1 ounces. Each ounce, applied with a Utilize action, bonds a square foot of surface after 1 minute. Only Universal Solvent, Oil of Etherealness, or Wish breaks the bond.","Staff of Birdcalls":"Has 10 charges. Magic action and 1 charge make a bird sound audible 120 feet away. Regains 1d6 + 4 at dawn. Using the last charge risks destruction on a 1.","Staff of Frost":"Grants Cold resistance. Has 10 charges: Fog Cloud 1, Ice Storm 4, Wall of Ice 4, Cone of Cold 5. Regains 1d6 + 4 at dawn. The last charge risks destruction on a 1.","Staff of Swarming Insects":"Has 10 charges. Magic action and 1 charge fill a 30-foot Emanation with insects for 10 minutes, Heavily Obscuring it. Giant Insect costs 4, Insect Plague 5. Regains 1d6 + 4 at dawn.","Staff of the Woodlands":"Quarterstaff with +2 and +2 to spell attacks. Has 6 charges for nature spells and Tree Form, a 60-foot tree, for 1. Regains 1d6 at dawn. Using the last charge risks ruin on a 1.","Sun Blade":"Hilt that creates a radiant Longsword blade with Finesse, +2, and Radiant damage as a Bonus Action. Undead take extra 1d8 Radiant. Sheds sunlight 15 feet bright and 15 feet dim, adjustable by Magic action.","Sword of Sharpness":"Glaive, Greatsword, Longsword, or Scimitar. Hits against objects deal maximum damage. A natural 20 on a creature adds extra 14 Slashing damage and 1 Exhaustion level.","Talisman of Pure Good":"Fiends and Undead touching it take 8d6 Radiant. Holy Symbol with +2 to spell attacks. Has 7 charges: Magic action and 1 charge open a fissure (DC 20 Dexterity save) that destroys the target.","Tentacle Rod":"Magic action: three tentacles attack creatures within 15 feet at +9 for 1d6 Psychic each. If all three hit one target, a DC 15 Dexterity save or it is Restrained and takes 3d6 each turn.","Tome of the Stilled Tongue":"Serves as your Spellbook and Arcane Focus. While held, cast one of its spells as a Bonus Action without a slot or Verbal and Somatic components, once per dawn. Removing the tongue erases the spells.","Wand of Binding":"Has 7 charges, regaining 1d6 + 1 at dawn. Cast Hold Person for 2 charges or Hold Monster for 5 (save DC 17). Using the last charge risks destruction on a 1.","Wand of Fireballs":"Has 7 charges, regaining 1d6 + 1 at dawn. Spend 1 to 3 charges to cast Fireball (DC 15) at level 3 plus 1 per extra charge. The last charge risks destruction on a 1.","Wand of Paralysis":"Has 7 charges, regaining 1d6 + 1 at dawn. Magic action and 1 charge: a ray at a creature within 60 feet, who makes a DC 15 Constitution save or is Paralyzed for 1 minute.","Weapon of Warning":"Any Simple or Martial weapon. While within reach, you and allies within 30 feet wake from natural sleep when combat starts and have Advantage on Initiative rolls.","Amulet of the Planes":"Magic action: name a known place on another plane and make a DC 15 Intelligence (Arcana) check. Success casts Plane Shift. Failure sends you and creatures within 15 feet to a random plane.","Armor of Resistance":"Light, Medium, or Heavy armor granting Resistance to one damage type chosen by the DM or rolled on a d10 from Acid through Thunder.","Arrow, +3":"Magic ammunition that gives +3 to attack and damage rolls. It becomes ordinary once it hits a target.","Bag of Beans":"Holds 3d4 beans. Dumping them out causes a 10-foot-radius explosion (DC 15 Dexterity save, 5d4 Force). Planting a bean and watering it triggers a random effect after 1 minute.","Bead of Force":"Magic action: throw within 60 feet to explode in a 10-foot-radius Sphere. Targets take 5d4 Force on a failed DC 15 Dexterity save and are trapped in a force sphere for 1 minute.","Bolt, +1":"Magic ammunition that gives +1 to attack and damage rolls. It becomes ordinary once it hits a target.","Book of Vile Darkness":"Artifact needing 80 hours of study. Casts Animate Dead, Circle of Death, Dominate Monster, or Finger of Death (DC 18) and grants Exhaustion immunity. Attuning risks a DC 17 Charisma save or becoming a Larva.","Brazier of Commanding Fire Elementals":"Within 5 feet of it, a Magic action summons a Fire Elemental that obeys you for 1 hour. A Bonus Action dismisses it. Usable once per dawn.","Carpet of Flying":"Magic action and command word make it fly at your direction within 30 feet. Sizes hold 200 to 800 pounds, with Fly Speeds from 80 down to 30 feet. Doubling the load halves speed.","Cloak of Arachnida":"Grants Poison resistance, a Climb Speed equal to your Speed, and immunity to webs. Casts Web (DC 13) at double the area once per dawn.","Cloak of the Bat":"Advantage on Dexterity (Stealth). In Dim Light or Darkness, gripping the edges gives a 40-foot Fly Speed, and you can cast Polymorph on yourself into a Bat once per dawn.","Cube of Summoning":"Magic action: turn the crank to cast a random level 5 Summon spell (DC 17, +9) without Concentration. Usable once per dawn.","Dancing Sword":"Greatsword, Longsword, Rapier, Scimitar, or Shortsword. Bonus Action: throw it to hover and attack within 30 feet using your attack roll and modifier. It attacks four times, then returns to your hand.","Deck of Many Things":"Legendary deck of 13 or 22 cards. Announce how many to draw, within 1 hour of each. Each card has a powerful boon or curse, from Wish and ability gains to imprisonment or death.","Dimensional Shackles":"Utilize action: lock onto an Incapacitated Small to Large creature. It can't teleport or travel between planes. It may try a DC 30 Athletics check once every 30 days to break free.","Dust of Dryness":"Packet of 1d6 + 4 pinches. Utilize action: a pinch shrinks up to a 15-foot Cube of water into a pellet. Against a watery Elemental within 5 feet, 10d6 Necrotic (DC 13 Constitution, half).","Elemental Gem":"Utilize action: break the gem to summon an elemental that obeys you for 1 hour. Sapphire gives Air, emerald Water, red corundum Fire, yellow diamond Earth. Bonus Action dismisses it.","Enspelled Armor (level 2 or 3 spell)":"Rare armor with a bound Abjuration or Illusion spell of level 2 or 3, cast for 1 of 6 charges. Regains 1d6 at dawn. Level 2: DC 13, +5. Level 3: DC 15, +7.","Enspelled Staff (cantrip or level 1 spell)":"Uncommon staff with a bound cantrip or level 1 spell, cast for 1 of 6 charges. Regains 1d6 at dawn. Save DC 13, attack bonus +5. Using the last charge risks ruin on a 1.","Enspelled Weapon":"Simple or Martial weapon with a bound spell of level 8 or lower, cast for 1 of 6 charges. Regains 1d6 at dawn. Save DC 13 to 18, attack +5 to +10 by spell level.","Enspelled Weapon (level 6, 7, or 8 spell)":"Legendary Simple or Martial weapon with a bound level 6 to 8 spell, cast for 1 of 6 charges. Regains 1d6 at dawn. Level 6: DC 17, +9. Levels 7 or 8: DC 18, +10.","Eyes of Charming":"Has 3 charges, all regained at dawn. Spend 1 or more to cast Charm Person (DC 13) at level 1, plus one level per extra charge.","Figurine of Wondrous Power (golden lions)":"Pair of statuettes. Magic action: throw one or both within 60 feet to become Lions for up to 1 hour each. Each figurine is inert for 7 days after use.","Figurine of Wondrous Power (onyx dog)":"Magic action: throw it within 60 feet to become a Mastiff ally for up to 6 hours, with Intelligence 8, Common, and Blindsight 60 feet. Inert for 7 days after use.","Firearm Bullet, +2":"Magic ammunition that gives +2 to attack and damage rolls. It becomes ordinary once it hits a target.","Frost Brand":"Glaive, Greatsword, Longsword, Rapier, Scimitar, or Shortsword. Hits deal extra 1d6 Cold. Held, it gives Fire resistance. When drawn, it can extinguish nonmagical flames within 30 feet, once per hour.","Gloves of Missile Snaring":"Reaction when a Ranged or Thrown weapon attack hits you and you have a free hand: reduce the damage by 1d10 + Dexterity modifier. At 0 damage you can catch the missile.","Hat of Many Spells":"Wizard Spellcasting Focus. Cast an unknown Wizard spell by spending a slot and passing an Arcana check (DC 10 + spell level). Success locks it until a rest. Failure causes a random effect.","Helm of Telepathy":"Gives telepathy out to 30 feet. Cast Detect Thoughts or Suggestion (DC 13) from it, each once per dawn.","Horn of Blasting":"Magic action: blast a 30-foot Cone. DC 15 Constitution save or take 5d8 Thunder and be Deafened for 1 minute, half on success. Each use has a 20 percent chance to explode for 10d6 Force.","Horn of Valhalla (iron)":"Magic action: call 5 Berserker spirits for 1 hour. They obey if you have proficiency with all Martial weapons, otherwise they attack you. Immune to Charmed and Frightened. Inert for 7 days.","Immovable Rod":"Utilize action: press the button to fix the rod in place, holding up to 8,000 pounds. Press again to release. A DC 30 Strength (Athletics) check moves it up to 10 feet.","Instrument of the Bards (Anstruth harp)":"Play to cast Fly, Invisibility, Levitate, Protection from Evil and Good, Cure Wounds (level 5), Ice Storm, or Wall of Thorns, each once per dawn, using your DC.","Instrument of the Bards (Fochlucan bandore)":"Play to cast Fly, Invisibility, Levitate, Protection from Evil and Good, Entangle, Faerie Fire, Shillelagh, or Speak with Animals, each once per dawn, using your DC.","Ioun Stone (absorption)":"Magic action to toss it into orbit. Reaction: cancel a spell of level 4 or lower cast by a creature you can see. After 20 total spell levels canceled, it burns out.","Ioun Stone (greater absorption)":"Magic action to toss it into orbit. Reaction: cancel a spell of level 8 or lower cast by a creature you can see. After 20 total spell levels canceled, it burns out.","Ioun Stone (mastery)":"Magic action to toss it so it orbits your head, up to three stones at once. While orbiting, your Proficiency Bonus increases by 1.","Ioun Stone (strength)":"Magic action to toss it so it orbits your head, up to three stones at once. While orbiting, your Strength score rises by 2, to a maximum of 20.","Javelin of Lightning":"Hits can deal Lightning instead of Piercing. Once per dawn, throw it as a 5-foot-wide Line up to 120 feet (DC 13 Dexterity save, 4d6 Lightning, half on success). It returns to your hand.","Lute of Thunderous Thumping":"Wielded as a magic Club that deals extra 2d8 Thunder damage on a hit. Bards who sing or hum can use Charisma instead of Strength for melee attack rolls with it.","Manual of Bodily Health":"Studying for 48 hours within 6 days raises your Constitution score by 2, to a maximum of 30. The book then loses its magic for a century.","Mariner's Armor":"Light, Medium, or Heavy armor giving a Swim Speed equal to your Speed. If you start your turn underwater at 0 HP, you regain 1d4 HP, once per dawn.","Nature's Mantle":"Cloak serving as a Spellcasting Focus for Ranger and Druid spells. In a Lightly Obscured area, you can Hide as a Bonus Action even while observed.","Needle, +2":"Magic ammunition that gives +2 to attack and damage rolls. It becomes ordinary once it hits a target.","Oathbow":"Longbow or Shortbow. Speak a phrase while attacking to mark a sworn enemy: Advantage, ignores partial cover, no long-range Disadvantage, and extra 3d6 Piercing. You have Disadvantage with other weapons while it lives.","Orb of Dragonkind":"Artifact crystal orb. Magic action to control it (DC 15 Charisma save or be Charmed). Has 7 charges for spells (DC 18). Calls chromatic dragons within 40 miles once per hour. AC 20.","Plate Armor of Etherealness":"Half Plate or Plate Armor. Magic action and command word gives the effect of Etherealness until removed or ended. Usable once per dawn.","Potion of Fire Breath":"After drinking, Bonus Action: breathe fire at a target within 30 feet. DC 13 Dexterity save, 4d6 Fire, half on success. Lasts three breaths or 1 hour.","Potion of Giant Strength (hill)":"Sets your Strength score to 21 for 1 hour. It does nothing if your Strength is already 21 or higher.","Potion of Longevity":"Makes you 1d6 + 6 years younger, never below age 13. Each later dose has a cumulative 10 percent chance to age you 1d6 + 6 years instead.","Prosthetic Limb":"Replaces a lost hand, arm, foot, or leg and works exactly like it. Removing or attaching it takes a Magic action. No one can take it from you against your will.","Quaal's Feather Token (fan)":"Single use. Magic action aboard a ship: throw it to create a floating fan that blows a ship 5 miles per hour faster for 8 hours. Magic action dismisses it.","Quarterstaff of the Acrobat":"Quarterstaff with +2 that sheds green Dim Light on command and shifts between 6-inch rod, Quarterstaff, and 10-foot pole. Gives Acrobatics Advantage, a Reaction +5 AC deflection, and a returning throw (30/120).","Ring of Mind Shielding":"Immunity to magic that reads thoughts, detects lies, or reveals alignment or creature type. Magic action hides or reveals the ring. Your soul can remain in it after death.","Ring of Spell Turning":"Advantage on saves against spells. A successful save against a spell of level 7 or lower negates it. For single-target spells, Reaction: send it back at the caster, who uses their own DC.","Robe of Eyes":"Advantage on sight-based Perception checks, plus Darkvision and Truesight to 120 feet. Light cast on the robe or Daylight within 5 feet Blinds you (DC 11 or 15 Constitution saves each turn).","Robe of Useful Items":"Magic action: pull off a patch to create the object or creature it shows. Always has two each of lantern, dagger, mirror, pole, rope, and sack patches, plus 4d4 random patches.","Rod of Resurrection":"Has 5 charges. Cast Heal for 1 charge or Resurrection for 5. Regains 1 charge at dawn. Using the last charge risks it vanishing on a 1.","Rod of the Pact Keeper, +2":"Gives +2 to spell attack rolls and Warlock spell save DCs while held. Magic action: regain one spell slot, usable once per Long Rest.","Rope of Mending":"50-foot rope that can be cut apart. Magic action: every touching piece not otherwise in use rejoins. Lost or destroyed sections stay missing.","Scroll of Titan Summoning":"Magic action to read: a titan appears within 1 mile, chosen by the DM or rolled (Animal Lord, Blob of Annihilation, Colossus, Elemental Cataclysm, Empyrean, Kraken, Tarrasque). It is Hostile to all.","Sling Bullet, +1":"Magic ammunition that gives +1 to attack and damage rolls. It becomes ordinary once it hits a target.","Sphere of Annihilation":"2-foot black sphere that obliterates matter. Touching it without being engulfed deals 8d10 Force. A Magic action and DC 25 Arcana check controls it. Controlled movement forces a DC 19 Dexterity save or 8d10 Force.","Staff of Charming":"Has 10 charges. Spend 1 to cast Charm Person, Command, or Comprehend Languages. Reaction for 1 charge reflects Enchantment spells. Resist Enchantment once per dawn. Regains 1d8 + 2.","Staff of Healing":"Has 10 charges. Cure Wounds costs 1 per spell level (up to 4), Lesser Restoration 2, Mass Cure Wounds 5. Regains 1d6 + 4 at dawn. Using the last charge risks loss on a 1.","Staff of the Adder":"Bonus Action: animate the head into a snake for 1 minute. One Attack action attack can use it, adding Proficiency and Wisdom modifiers, dealing 1d6 Piercing plus 3d6 Poison. AC 15, 20 HP.","Staff of Thunder and Lightning":"Quarterstaff with +2. Each of its properties works once per dawn: extra 2d6 Lightning, stunning Thunder (DC 17), both together, a 9d6 Lightning Line, and a Thunderclap that Deafens and deals 2d6.","Sword of Answering":"Longsword with +3. Reaction when a creature within reach damages you: attack it in melee with Advantage, ignoring its Resistance and Immunity to the damage.","Sword of Vengeance":"Cursed weapon with +1. While attuned, other weapons have Disadvantage. When damaged, make a DC 15 Wisdom save or you must keep attacking that creature. Banishment frees you, leaving a +1 weapon.","Talisman of the Sphere":"Advantage on Arcana checks to control a Sphere of Annihilation. Magic action: move a controlled sphere 10 feet plus 10 times your Intelligence modifier, along any path.","Thunderous Greatclub":"Sets your Strength to 20 and adds 1d8 Thunder to hits (3d8 to objects). Magic action: Clap of Thunder (DC 15 Strength) knocks Prone, or once per dawn Earthquake (DC 20) in a 50-foot radius.","Tome of Understanding":"Reading and practicing for 48 hours within 6 days raises your Wisdom score by 2, to a maximum of 30. The magic then fades for a century.","Wand of Conducting":"Has 3 charges, all regained at dawn. Magic action and 1 charge: wave it to produce orchestral music audible 120 feet away. The last charge risks destruction on a 1.","Wand of Lightning Bolts":"Has 7 charges, regaining 1d6 + 1 at dawn. Spend 1 to 3 charges to cast Lightning Bolt (DC 15) at level 3 plus 1 per extra charge. Last charge risks destruction.","Wand of Pyrotechnics":"Has 7 charges, regaining 1d6 + 1 at dawn. Magic action and 1 charge: a harmless flash within 120 feet with a crackle heard 300 feet away. The last charge risks destruction on a 1.","Well of Many Worlds":"Magic action: spread the cloth to open a 6-foot two-way portal to another world or plane chosen by the DM. Closed by a Magic action within 5 feet. Then 1d8 hours before reuse.","Animated Shield":"Bonus Action: the Shield floats and guards you for 1 minute, freeing your hands. A Bonus Action ends it early. It ends if you die or are Incapacitated.","Armor of Vulnerability":"Cursed armor giving Resistance to Bludgeoning, Piercing, or Slashing, but Vulnerability to the other two. Attuning applies the curse, which lasts until Remove Curse or similar magic.","Arrow-Catching Shield":"Shield giving +2 AC against ranged attacks, on top of its normal bonus. Reaction: become the target of a ranged attack aimed at a creature or object within 5 feet.","Bag of Devouring":"Looks like a Bag of Holding but eats animal and plant matter inside. Reaching in risks a 50 percent chance of being dragged in (escape DC 15 Athletics). Creatures inside are devoured at turn start.","Belt of Dwarvenkind":"Grants Dwarvish, Advantage on Persuasion with dwarves and duergar, and +2 Constitution (max 20). Non-dwarves also gain Darkvision 60 feet, Poison resistance, and Advantage on saves against Poisoned.","Bolt, +2":"Magic ammunition that gives +2 to attack and damage rolls. It becomes ordinary once it hits a target.","Boots of Speed":"Bonus Action: click heels to double your Speed, and Opportunity Attacks against you have Disadvantage. Works for a total of 10 minutes until a Long Rest.","Broom of Flying":"Magic action: float beneath you with a 50-foot Fly Speed. Carries 400 pounds, but speed drops to 30 feet above 200 pounds. A Magic action sends it up to 1 mile away or recalls it.","Cauldron of Rebirth":"Spellcasting Focus. After a Long Rest, 1 minute makes a Potion of Healing (greater). Magic action: Raise Dead on a corpse buried in 200 pounds of salt for 8 hours, once per 7 days.","Cloak of Displacement":"Illusion gives attackers Disadvantage against you. It stops working until your next turn after you take damage, and while your Speed is 0.","Clockwork Amulet":"When you make an attack roll, you can treat the d20 as a 10 instead of rolling. Recharges at dawn.","Cubic Gate":"Cube with 3 charges, regaining 1d3 at dawn. Magic action and 1 charge: press a face once to cast Gate, twice to cast Plane Shift, to the plane linked to that face.","Dark Shard Amulet":"Spellcasting Focus for Warlock spells. Magic action: try to cast an unlearned Warlock cantrip with a DC 10 Intelligence (Arcana) check. Usable once per Long Rest.","Defender":"Melee weapon with +3 to attack and damage. On your first attack each turn, shift some or all of the bonus to your AC until your next turn.","Dragon Scale Mail":"Scale Mail giving +1 AC, Advantage on saves against Dragon breath, and Resistance to one damage type by dragon kind. Magic action senses the nearest such dragon within 30 miles, once per dawn.","Dust of Sneezing and Choking":"Looks like Dust of Disappearance. Utilize action: creatures in a 30-foot Emanation make a DC 15 Constitution save or are Incapacitated by sneezing and suffocating, repeating the save each turn.","Energy Bow":"Stringless Longbow or Shortbow with +1 that makes Force arrows. Can restrain a hit target (DC 15 Strength), teleport a target within 10 feet with a Magic action, or form a 60-foot energy ladder.","Enspelled Armor (level 4 or 5 spell)":"Very Rare armor with a bound Abjuration or Illusion spell of level 4 or 5, cast for 1 of 6 charges. Regains 1d6 at dawn. Level 4: DC 15, +7. Level 5: DC 17, +9.","Enspelled Staff (level 2 or 3 spell)":"Rare staff with a bound level 2 or 3 spell, cast for 1 of 6 charges. Regains 1d6 at dawn. Level 2: DC 13, +5. Level 3: DC 15, +7.","Enspelled Weapon (cantrip or level 1 spell)":"Uncommon Simple or Martial weapon with a bound cantrip or level 1 spell, cast for 1 of 6 charges. Regains 1d6 at dawn. Save DC 13, attack bonus +5.","Ersatz Eye":"Replaces a lost eye and works like a natural one. Putting it in or taking it out takes a Magic action. No one can remove it against your will while you live.","Figurine of Wondrous Power":"Statuette that becomes a friendly creature when tossed within 60 feet with a Magic action. Types include griffon, fly, lions, goats, elephant, steed, dog, owl, and raven, each with its own duration and wait.","Figurine of Wondrous Power (ivory goats)":"Set of three, thrown with a Magic action within 60 feet. Terror (3 hours) offers a +1 Lance, +2 Longsword, and fear aura (DC 15). Traveling has 24 charges. Travail lasts 3 hours.","Figurine of Wondrous Power (serpentine owl)":"Magic action: throw it within 60 feet to become a Giant Owl for up to 8 hours, with telepathy at any distance on the same plane. Inert for 2 days after use.","Firearm Bullet, +3":"Magic ammunition that gives +3 to attack and damage rolls. It becomes ordinary once it hits a target.","Gem of Brightness":"Has 50 charges. Magic action: first word sheds light free. Second word spends 1 charge to blind a creature within 60 feet (DC 15 Constitution). Third word spends 5 for a 30-foot Cone.","Hag Eye":"Has 3 charges, regained at dawn. Spend 1 to cast Darkvision on yourself or See Invisibility. A hag from the coven that made it can see through it with a Magic action.","Hat of Vermin":"Has 3 charges, all regained at dawn. Magic action and 1 charge: summon a Bat, Frog, or Rat that flees, Indifferent, uncontrolled, for up to 1 hour.","Heward's Handy Haversack":"Backpack with three extradimensional pouches holding 200, 200, and 500 pounds. It weighs 5 pounds, and the item you want is always on top. Retrieval takes a Utilize or Bonus Action.","Horn of Valhalla":"Magic action: call Berserker spirits for 1 hour. Silver brings 2, brass 3, bronze 4, iron 5, with weapon or armor requirements except silver. If unmet, they attack you. Inert for 7 days.","Horn of Valhalla (silver)":"Magic action: call 2 Berserker spirits for 1 hour. No requirement, so they are always friendly and obey you. Immune to Charmed and Frightened. Inert for 7 days after use.","Instrument of Illusions":"While playing, Magic action: create harmless silent visual illusions in a 5-foot Emanation, or 15 feet for Bards. The effects end when you stop playing.","Instrument of the Bards (Canaith mandolin)":"Play to cast Fly, Invisibility, Levitate, Protection from Evil and Good, Cure Wounds (level 3), Dispel Magic, or Protection from Energy (Lightning only), each once per dawn.","Instrument of the Bards (Mac-Fuirmidh cittern)":"Play to cast Fly, Invisibility, Levitate, Protection from Evil and Good, Barkskin, Cure Wounds, or Fog Cloud, each once per dawn, using your DC.","Ioun Stone (agility)":"Magic action to toss it so it orbits your head, up to three stones at once. While orbiting, your Dexterity score rises by 2, to a maximum of 20.","Ioun Stone (insight)":"Magic action to toss it so it orbits your head, up to three stones at once. While orbiting, your Wisdom score rises by 2, to a maximum of 20.","Ioun Stone (protection)":"Magic action to toss it so it orbits your head, up to three stones at once. While orbiting, you gain a +1 bonus to Armor Class.","Ioun Stone (sustenance)":"Magic action to toss it so it orbits your head, up to three stones at once. While orbiting, you need no food or drink.","Keoghtom's Ointment":"Jar of 1d4 + 1 doses. Utilize action: swallow or apply a dose within 5 feet to restore 2d8 + 2 Hit Points and end the Poisoned condition.","Mace of Disruption":"Mace dealing extra 2d6 Radiant to Fiends and Undead. If that leaves one at 25 HP or less, it makes a DC 15 Wisdom save or is destroyed, otherwise Frightened. Sheds Bright Light 20 feet.","Manual of Gainful Exercise":"Studying for 48 hours within 6 days raises your Strength score by 2, to a maximum of 30. The book then loses its magic for a century.","Mirror of Life Trapping":"4-foot mirror (AC 11, 10 HP). Magic action activates it. Creatures seeing their reflection within 30 feet make a DC 15 Charisma save or are trapped in one of 12 cells.","Necklace of Fireballs":"Has 1d6 + 3 beads. Magic action: throw a bead up to 60 feet to explode as a level 3 Fireball (DC 15). Extra beads thrown together add 1d6 each, up to 12d6.","Needle, +3":"Magic ammunition that gives +3 to attack and damage rolls. It becomes ordinary once it hits a target.","Oil of Etherealness":"One vial coats a Medium or smaller creature in 10 minutes, granting the effect of Etherealness for 1 hour. Larger sizes need extra vials.","Periapt of Wound Closure":"A Death Saving Throw roll of 9 or lower counts as a 10. Each Hit Point Die you roll to heal restores twice the normal Hit Points.","Portable Hole":"Black cloth. Magic action: unfold it into a 6-foot-wide, 10-foot-deep extradimensional hole. Magic action closes it. Trapped creatures escape with a DC 10 Athletics check. Mixing it with Bag of Holding destroys both.","Potion of Giant Strength (cloud)":"Sets your Strength score to 27 for 1 hour. It does nothing if your Strength is already 27 or higher.","Potion of Giant Strength (stone)":"Sets your Strength score to 23 for 1 hour. It does nothing if your Strength is already 23 or higher.","Potion of Poison":"Disguised as a helpful potion. Drinking it deals 4d6 Poison damage and a DC 13 Constitution save, or you are Poisoned for 1 hour. Identify reveals it.","Quaal's Feather Token":"Single-use feather. Kinds are anchor, bird, fan, swan boat, tree, and whip, each rolled on a d100 table. Rarity is Uncommon or Rare by kind.","Quaal's Feather Token (swan boat)":"Single use. Magic action: touch to water at least 60 feet across to make a 50-by-20-foot swan boat moving 6 miles per hour for 24 hours. A Magic action steers or dismisses it.","Quiver of Ehlonna":"Weighs 2 pounds. Three extradimensional compartments hold 60 arrows or bolts, 18 javelins, and 6 long items such as bows, Quarterstaffs, or spears.","Ring of Resistance":"Grants Resistance to one damage type shown by its gemstone, chosen by the DM or rolled on a d10 from Acid through Thunder.","Ring of the Ram":"3 charges, regaining 1d3 at dawn. Magic action: spend 1 to 3 for a +7 ranged spell attack dealing 2d10 Force per charge and a 5-foot shove. Or smash an object (+5 Strength per charge).","Robe of Scintillating Colors":"Has 3 charges, regaining 1d3 at dawn. Magic action and 1 charge: until your next turn ends, attackers have Disadvantage, and viewers in Bright Light make a DC 15 Wisdom save or are Stunned.","Rod of Absorption":"Reaction: absorb a single-target spell aimed at you, storing its levels. Holds 50 levels total. Spellcasters can convert stored levels into spell slots up to level 5.","Rod of Rulership":"Magic action: creatures you choose within 120 feet make a DC 15 Wisdom save or are Charmed for 8 hours. Harm or against-nature orders end it. Usable once per dawn.","Rod of the Pact Keeper, +3":"Gives +3 to spell attack rolls and Warlock spell save DCs while held. Magic action: regain one spell slot, usable once per Long Rest.","Ruby of the War Mage":"After 10 minutes attaching it, a Simple or Martial weapon serves as your Spellcasting Focus. A Magic action detaches it.","Sending Stones":"Paired stones. While touching one, cast Sending to the other's bearer. After use, neither stone works until the next dawn. If one is destroyed, the other loses its magic.","Sling Bullet, +2":"Magic ammunition that gives +2 to attack and damage rolls. It becomes ordinary once it hits a target.","Spirit Board":"Has 3 charges, regaining 1 at dawn. While touching the planchette, spend 1 minute to cast Augury for 1 charge or Commune for 3 charges. Works only with the planchette on the lettered side.","Staff of Fire":"Grants Fire resistance. Has 10 charges: Burning Hands 1, Fireball 3, Wall of Fire 4. Regains 1d6 + 4 at dawn. The last charge risks destruction on a 1.","Staff of Power":"Quarterstaff with +2, and +2 to AC, saves, and spell attacks. Has 20 charges for spells, regaining 2d8 + 4 at dawn. Retributive Strike breaks it for a 30-foot explosion (DC 17 Dexterity).","Staff of the Magi":"Quarterstaff with +2 and +2 to spell attacks. Has 50 charges for many spells, regaining 4d6 + 2 at dawn. Advantage on saves against spells. Reaction: absorb a spell targeting you. Retributive Strike breaks it.","Staff of Withering":"Quarterstaff with 3 charges, regaining 1d3 at dawn. On a hit, spend 1 charge for extra 2d10 Necrotic and a DC 15 Constitution save or Disadvantage on Strength and Constitution rolls for 1 hour.","Sword of Kas":"Artifact longsword with +3, crits on 19 or 20, and extra 2d10 Slashing against Undead. Casts Call Lightning, Divine Word, or Finger of Death (DC 18). Adds 1d10 to Initiative and gives Necrotic resistance.","Sword of Wounding":"Glaive, Greatsword, Longsword, Rapier, Scimitar, or Shortsword. Hits deal extra 2d6 Necrotic, and the target makes a DC 15 Constitution save or can't regain Hit Points for 1 hour.","Talisman of Ultimate Evil":"Non-Fiends and non-Undead touching it take 8d6 Necrotic. Holy Symbol with +2 to spell attacks. Has 6 charges: Magic action and 1 charge open a fissure (DC 20 Dexterity save) that destroys the target.","Tome of Clear Thought":"Reading and practicing for 48 hours within 6 days raises your Intelligence score by 2, to a maximum of 30. The magic then fades for a century.","Universal Solvent":"Tube holding 1d6 + 1 ounces. Utilize action: pour on a surface within reach. Each ounce dissolves up to 1 square foot of adhesive, including Sovereign Glue.","Wand of Enemy Detection":"Has 7 charges, regaining 1d6 + 1 at dawn. Magic action and 1 charge: for 1 minute, sense the direction of the nearest hostile creature within 60 feet, even if hidden.","Wand of Magic Missiles":"Has 7 charges, regaining 1d6 + 1 at dawn. Spend 1 to 3 charges to cast Magic Missile at level 1 plus 1 per extra charge. The last charge risks destruction on a 1.","Wand of Wonder":"Has 7 charges, regaining 1d6 + 1 at dawn. Magic action and 1 charge: pick a point within 120 feet and roll a d100 for a random effect (DC 15), from spells to oddities.","Whelm":"Artifact warhammer with +3 and a returning throw (60/180) adding 1d8 Force, or 4d8 against Giants, Elementals, and Constructs. Magic action: Shock Wave stuns within 60 feet (DC 20 Constitution) once per dawn."};
